<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$30 bln government bonds in Aug.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$30 bln government bonds in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's finance ministry said on Friday it planned to issue T$30 billion in certificate-less government bonds in August.  </p>
<p>&quot;The issue will come some time in August, but no specific date is available at this point,&quot; finance ministry treasury head Chang Hsiu-lien told reporters.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (886-2-5080815)</p>
</text>
